# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates how to run a utility-scale error mitigation "
"experiment with Qiskit Runtime using an experimental version of *zero-noise "
"extrapolation* (ZNE) with *probabilistic error amplification* (PEA).\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento tutoriál ukazuje, jak spustit experiment chybové mitigace v utility-"
"scale měřítku pomocí Qiskit Runtime s experimentální verzí *extrapolace "
"nulového šumu* (ZNE) s *probabilistickým zesílením chyb* (PEA).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![kim\\_nature\\_fig.png](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/images/tutorials/utility-scale-error-mitigation-with-probabilistic-error-amplification/e1e67c34-9d4d-4a88-9340-f0b2f3676770.avif)\n"
"**Reference**: Y. Kim et al. *Evidence for the utility of quantum computing before fault tolerance.* [Nature 618.7965 (2023)](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-023-06096-3)\n"
msgstr ""
"![kim\\_nature\\_fig.png](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/images/tutorials/utility-scale-error-mitigation-with-probabilistic-error-amplification/e1e67c34-9d4d-4a88-9340-f0b2f3676770.avif)\n"
"**Zdroj**: Y. Kim et al. *Evidence for the utility of quantum computing before fault tolerance.* [Nature 618.7965 (2023)](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-023-06096-3)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Zero-noise extrapolation (ZNE) {#zero-noise-extrapolation-zne}"
msgstr "Extrapolace nulového šumu (ZNE) {#zero-noise-extrapolation-zne}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Zero-noise extrapolation (ZNE) is an error mitigation technique that removes"
" the effects of an *unknown* noise during circuit execution that can be "
"scaled in a *known* way.\n"
msgstr ""
"Extrapolace nulového šumu (ZNE) je technika chybové mitigace, která "
"odstraňuje vliv *neznámého* šumu při provádění Circuit, přičemž tento šum "
"lze škálovat *známým* způsobem.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "It assumes expectation values scale with noise by a known function\n"
msgstr ""
"Předpokládá, že střední hodnoty se škálují se šumem pomocí známé funkce\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle A(\\lambda) \\rangle = \\langle A(0) \\rangle + \\sum_{k=0}^{m} a_k \\lambda^k + R\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle A(\\lambda) \\rangle = \\langle A(0) \\rangle + \\sum_{k=0}^{m} a_k \\lambda^k + R\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "where $\\lambda$ parameterizes the noise strength and can be amplified.\n"
msgstr "kde $\\lambda$ parametrizuje sílu šumu a lze ji zesílit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We can implement ZNE with the following steps:\n"
msgstr "ZNE lze implementovat pomocí následujících kroků:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Amplify circuit noise for several noise factors $\\lambda_1, \\lambda_2, ..."
" $\n"
msgstr "Zesil šum Circuit pro několik faktorů šumu $\\lambda_1, \\lambda_2, ... $\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run every noise-amplified circuit to measure $\\langle "
"A(\\lambda_1)\\rangle, ...$\n"
msgstr ""
"Spusť každý obvod se zesíleným šumem a změř $\\langle A(\\lambda_1)\\rangle,"
" ...$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Extrapolate back to the zero-noise limit $\\langle A(0)\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "Extrapoluj zpět k nulové hranici šumu $\\langle A(0)\\rangle$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![zne\\_stages.png](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/images/tutorials/utility-"
"scale-error-mitigation-with-probabilistic-error-"
"amplification/5e63d706-82d8-4212-b802-c9191ce53341.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![zne\\_stages.png](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/images/tutorials/utility-"
"scale-error-mitigation-with-probabilistic-error-"
"amplification/5e63d706-82d8-4212-b802-c9191ce53341.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Amplify noise for ZNE {#amplify-noise-for-zne}"
msgstr "Zesílení šumu pro ZNE {#amplify-noise-for-zne}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The main challenge in successfully implementing ZNE is to have an accurate "
"model for noise in the expectation value and to amplify the noise in a known"
" way.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hlavní výzvou při úspěšné implementaci ZNE je mít přesný model šumu pro "
"střední hodnotu a zesílit šum známým způsobem.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are three common ways error amplification is implemented for ZNE.\n"
msgstr "Existují tři běžné způsoby implementace zesílení chyb pro ZNE.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| **Pulse stretching**                                                                                                                                                                               | **Gate folding**                                                                                                                                                                               | **Probabilistic error amplification**                                                                                                                                                |\n"
"| -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Scale pulse duration via calibration                                                                                                                                                               | Repeat gates in identity cycles $U\\mapsto U(U^{-1}U)^{\\lambda-1}/2$                                                                                                                            | Add noise via sampling Pauli channels                                                                                                                                                |\n"
"| ![zne\\_pulse\\_stretching.png](/docs/images/tutorials/utility-scale-error-mitigation-with-probabilistic-error-amplification/83188b57-e88f-43a1-a7bd-29327f46ecf5.avif) | ![zne\\_gate\\_folding.png](/docs/images/tutorials/utility-scale-error-mitigation-with-probabilistic-error-amplification/e1358d08-2632-4fd2-bf0f-f9384a2d3340.avif) | ![zne\\_pea.png](/docs/images/tutorials/utility-scale-error-mitigation-with-probabilistic-error-amplification/3d69d5bd-70e5-4eeb-aa02-fc0a62043010.avif) |\n"
"| Kandala et al. Nature (2019)                                                                                                                                                                       | Shultz et al. PRA (2022)                                                                                                                                                                       | Li & Benjamin PRX (2017)                                                                                                                                                             |\n"
"For utility-scale experiments, *probabilistic error amplification* (PEA) is the most attractive.\n"
msgstr ""
"| **Roztažení pulzů**                                                                                                                                                                               | **Skládání Gate**                                                                                                                                                                               | **Probabilistické zesílení chyb**                                                                                                                                                |\n"
"| -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Škálování délky pulzů pomocí kalibrace                                                                                                                                                               | Opakování Gate v identitních cyklech $U\\mapsto U(U^{-1}U)^{\\lambda-1}/2$                                                                                                                            | Přidání šumu vzorkováním Pauliho kanálů                                                                                                                                                |\n"
"| ![zne\\_pulse\\_stretching.png](/docs/images/tutorials/utility-scale-error-mitigation-with-probabilistic-error-amplification/83188b57-e88f-43a1-a7bd-29327f46ecf5.avif) | ![zne\\_gate\\_folding.png](/docs/images/tutorials/utility-scale-error-mitigation-with-probabilistic-error-amplification/e1358d08-2632-4fd2-bf0f-f9384a2d3340.avif) | ![zne\\_pea.png](/docs/images/tutorials/utility-scale-error-mitigation-with-probabilistic-error-amplification/3d69d5bd-70e5-4eeb-aa02-fc0a62043010.avif) |\n"
"| Kandala et al. Nature (2019)                                                                                                                                                                       | Shultz et al. PRA (2022)                                                                                                                                                                       | Li & Benjamin PRX (2017)                                                                                                                                                             |\n"
"Pro experimenty v utility-scale měřítku je *probabilistické zesílení chyb* (PEA) nejatraktivnější.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Pulse stretching assumes gate noise is proportional to duration, which is "
"typically not true. Calibration is also costly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Roztažení pulzů předpokládá, že šum Gate je úměrný délce, což typicky "
"neplatí. Kalibrace je také nákladná.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Gate folding requires large stretch factors that greatly limit the depth of "
"circuits that can be run.\n"
msgstr ""
"Skládání Gate vyžaduje velké faktory roztažení, které značně omezují hloubku"
" Circuit, které lze spustit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"PEA can be applied to any circuit that can be run with native noise factor "
"($\\lambda=1$) but requires learning the noise model.\n"
msgstr ""
"PEA lze aplikovat na jakýkoli Circuit, který lze spustit s nativním faktorem"
" šumu ($\\lambda=1$), ale vyžaduje naučení modelu šumu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Learn the noise model for PEA {#learn-the-noise-model-for-pea}"
msgstr "Naučení modelu šumu pro PEA {#learn-the-noise-model-for-pea}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"PEA assumes the same layer-based noise model as *probabilistic error "
"cancellation* (PEC); however, it avoids the sampling overhead that scales "
"exponentially with the circuit noise.\n"
msgstr ""
"PEA předpokládá stejný vrstvený model šumu jako *probabilistické rušení "
"chyb* (PEC); vyhýbá se však vzorkovací režii, která roste exponenciálně s "
"šumem Circuit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| **Step 1**                                                                                                                                                                                       | **Step 2**                                                                                                                                                                                    | **Step 3**                                                                                                                                                                                      |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Pauli twirl layers of two-qubit gates                                                                                                                                                            | Repeat identity pairs of layers and learn the noise                                                                                                                                           | Derive a fidelity (error for each noise channel)                                                                                                                                                |\n"
"| ![pec\\_pauli\\_twirling.png](/docs/images/tutorials/utility-scale-error-mitigation-with-probabilistic-error-amplification/2eab5ff4-40fa-4a41-9f2c-74f5e22c4643.avif) | ![pec\\_learn\\_layer.png](/docs/images/tutorials/utility-scale-error-mitigation-with-probabilistic-error-amplification/8d0d64c3-65ad-4419-8ac9-4ec9633d39a0.avif) | ![pec\\_curve\\_fitting.png](/docs/images/tutorials/utility-scale-error-mitigation-with-probabilistic-error-amplification/c51bd42d-2463-4c78-807b-d284ca79296f.avif) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| **Krok 1**                                                                                                                                                                                       | **Krok 2**                                                                                                                                                                                    | **Krok 3**                                                                                                                                                                                      |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Pauliho zkroucení vrstev dvouQubitových Gate                                                                                                                                                            | Opakování identitních párů vrstev a učení šumu                                                                                                                                           | Odvození věrnosti (chyby pro každý šumový kanál)                                                                                                                                                |\n"
"| ![pec\\_pauli\\_twirling.png](/docs/images/tutorials/utility-scale-error-mitigation-with-probabilistic-error-amplification/2eab5ff4-40fa-4a41-9f2c-74f5e22c4643.avif) | ![pec\\_learn\\_layer.png](/docs/images/tutorials/utility-scale-error-mitigation-with-probabilistic-error-amplification/8d0d64c3-65ad-4419-8ac9-4ec9633d39a0.avif) | ![pec\\_curve\\_fitting.png](/docs/images/tutorials/utility-scale-error-mitigation-with-probabilistic-error-amplification/c51bd42d-2463-4c78-807b-d284ca79296f.avif) |\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Reference**: E. van den Berg, Z. Minev, A. Kandala, and K. Temme, "
