msgid ""
"First, choose a backend to run on. This demonstration runs on a 127-qubit "
"backend, but you can modify this to any backend available to you.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nejprve zvol Backend, na kterém budeš spouštět. Tato ukázka běží na "
